te provides the combination of proven reliability and crew\u2011morale creation that C does; the alternatives have more serious crew\u2011interaction or reliability gaps.\n**Remaining uncertainty:** Whether C\u2019s communication deficits have led (or could lead) to operational problems or crew friction, and whether his reluctance to pursue further education will affect long\u2011term professional development.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that C\u2019s communication issues have caused safety\u2011critical incidents or persistent crew conflict, or credible evidence that another candidate (e.g., D or B) possesses strong, documented crew\u2011communication/teamwork abilities that outweigh their interpersonal weaknesses.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
